     "gn_url": null,
     "desc": "Lathan Martin and Boone Shockley, with Grand Missouri Bank, in Bolivar, Missouri, recently completed the Oklahoma Bankers Association Consumer Lending School in Oklahoma City. Martin and Shockley were among 64 […]",
