     "title": "Marshfield Chevrolet Celebrates 100 Years in the Community",
     "source": "Marshfield Mail",
     "url": "https://marshfieldmail.com/2026/10/13/marshfield-chevrolet-celebrates-100-years-in-the-community/",
     "gn_url": null,
     "desc": "A century in business is something worth celebrating, and Marshfield Chevrolet is doing just that as the dealership marks 100 years of serving the community. The dealership welcomed customers, friends, […]",
     "outlets": 1,
     "also": [],
     "signal": "",
     "score": 14.1,
